OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian oil tankers as
OL,4,ATehran targets American base in Jordan
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS forces struck five Iranian tankers
OL,7,Fon Tuesday, sinking one, in response to
OL,8,FTehran twice targeting an American
OL,9,Fwarship, US Central Command (Centcom)
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FFour Iranian oil tankers in the Gulf of
OL,13,FOman linked to Iran's Revolutionary
OL,14,FGuards Corps (IRGC) were targeted, as
OL,15,Fwell as another near Kharg Island, a
OL,16,Fmajor oil terminal off Iran's coast,
OL,17,FCentcom added.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
