OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian oil tankers as
OL,4,ATehran targets American base in Jordan
OL,5,
OL,6,FTehran responded by launching missiles
OL,7,Fat a US base in Jordan - most of which
OL,8,Fwere shot down - and said it attacked
OL,9,Ftwo US vessels and eight oil tankers in
OL,10,Fthe Strait of Hormuz.
OL,12,FTit-for-tat strikes between the two
OL,13,Fcountries have escalated in the past
OL,14,Fweek, more than six months after the US
OL,15,Fand Israel launched attacks on Iran on
OL,16,F28 February.
